SUMMARY:[Task] Profile 1/7: Switch to a professional account
DESCRIPTION:☐ Instagram → your profile → ☰ → Account type and too
 ls → Switch to professional account.\n☐ Choose Business (a brand\, not
  a person): it unlocks insights\, contact options and boosting.\n☐ Categ
 ory: search “Sports & Recreation” and pick it. Leave “Display on pro
 file” on.\n☐ Skip the contact and Facebook steps for now (step 6 has t
 he optional email).\n\nCATEGORY:\nSports & Recreation\n\n• Not App Page:
  that label sits under your name and contradicts “no app to download”.
