SUMMARY:[Task] Profile 6/7: Privacy\, sharing and security
DESCRIPTION:☐ Settings → Account privacy: Private account off (public).
 \n☐ Settings → Sharing and reuse: allow sharing posts and reels to sto
 ries\, remixing and downloads. Shares and sends are how new people find yo
 u.\n☐ Settings → Notifications: comments\, mentions and messages on\, 
 so you can reply within the hour.\n☐ Accounts Center → Password and se
 curity → Two-factor authentication: on. It's the brand account\; keep it
  locked down.\n☐ Optional: Edit profile → Contact options → add a bu
 siness email you check.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Task: Profile 6/7: Privacy\, sharing and security
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
