SUMMARY:[Reel] Grid 1/9: JaxSquares is live (How it works)
DESCRIPTION:Thursday Night Football · Patriots at Bears · 8:15 PM ET · P
 rime Video\nAsset: 01-how-it-works.mp4\, r-grid-covers/01.png\n\nCAPTION:\
 nJaxSquares is live 🏈🏀🐶 Square 1 of 9.\n\nFootball and basketball
  squares\, run for you: pick the game\, text one link\, and everyone grabs
  squares from their phone. Jax draws the numbers live\, scores update them
 selves\, and the winning square lights up every quarter.\n\nFree to set up
 . No app. No signup. Running a Patriots–Bears board tonight? Link in bio
 .\n\nSend this to whoever runs your squares 📲\n\n#footballsquares #squa
 respool #basketballsquares #gameday #bears\n\nAlt text: Screen recording o
 f JaxSquares\, the football and basketball squares app: a live score lands
  on a winning square\, then picking a game\, texting the board link\, frie
 nds picking squares and Jax drawing the numbers.\n\n• At 48 hours (Sat O
 ct 24\, 12:30): Insights → plays\, average watch time\, skip rate\, send
 s\, saves\, profile visits.\n• Has its own soundtrack: original JaxSquar
 es music\, cut to the video\, so post it as is (it shows as Original audio
 \, and it's yours to boost).\n• Cover: save the grid cover above. On the
  share screen tap Edit cover → Add from camera roll → pick it\, then o
 pen the Profile grid tab: the whole square shows\, board map included.\n
 • Don't pin it: pinned posts jump to the top of the grid and break the l
 ogo.\n• Square 1 sits bottom right of the logo.
