SUMMARY:[Reel] Grid 7/9: Free to set up (Squares board speedrun)
DESCRIPTION:Asset: u1-speedrun.mp4\, r-grid-covers/07.png\n\nCAPTION:\nMake
  a squares board in 10 seconds ⏱ Square 7 of 9.\n\nPick the game\, how s
 quares win\, prizes or just for fun\, a name\, create. Then one text to th
 e group chat. 10 seconds flat with the defaults\; read every step and it's
  still under a minute.\n\nFree to set up and invite\, and players never pa
 y. Boards with up to 5 players draw free\; bigger boards are $4.99 for the
  host at the draw.\n\nSend this to whoever still makes the board on paper.
  Link in bio.\n\n#footballsquares #squarespool #officepool #gameday\n\nAlt
  text: Screen recording of the JaxSquares squares app with a running stopw
 atch: picking a game\, choosing how squares win\, Just for fun\, naming th
 e board and creating it\, then sending the invite to a group chat. The sto
 pwatch stops at 10 seconds.\n\n• At 48 hours (Fri Oct 30\, 12:30): Insig
 hts → plays\, average watch time\, skip rate\, sends\, saves\, profile v
 isits.\n• Has its own soundtrack: original JaxSquares music\, cut to the
  video\, so post it as is (it shows as Original audio\, and it's yours to 
 boost).\n• Cover: save the grid cover above. On the share screen tap Edi
 t cover → Add from camera roll → pick it\, then open the Profile grid 
 tab: the whole square shows\, board map included.\n• Don't pin it: pinne
 d posts jump to the top of the grid and break the logo.\n• Square 7: top
  row\, right.\n• Not a boost pick: the review step shows the host-fee li
 ne.
