SUMMARY:[Reel (film it)] Founder Reel: why we built it (and who Jax is)
DESCRIPTION:Script:\n- 0–2s (on-screen text): “I built a squares app be
 cause our group chat broke.”\n- 2–10s: hold up the old way. Show the w
 hiteboard photo\, the spreadsheet\, the 99+ unread chat.\n- 10–25s: scre
 en-record making a real board\, start to share link (you recorded this in 
 Prep).\n- 25–35s\, to camera: “Free to set up\, no app\, no signup. Ja
 x draws the numbers live\, winners light up.” If you can\, film the real
  Jax here: he's the logo.\n- 35–40s\, ask: “What do we build next: Pic
 k'em\, Bracket Battles\, or King of the Hill?”\n\nCAPTION:\nWhy we built
  JaxSquares 🐶 (and what's next)\n\nOur squares lived in a group chat\, 
 a blurry whiteboard photo and a spreadsheet nobody could find. So we built
  the board we wanted\, and named it after Jax: one link\, everyone picks f
 rom their phone\, numbers draw live\, winners light up.\n\nNext up: Pick'e
 m\, Bracket Battles or King of the Hill? Vote in the comments 👇\n\n#bui
 ldinpublic #startup #jacksonville #footballsquares #squarespool\n\n• Fil
 m vertical\, natural light\, captions on (Instagram's auto-captions are fi
 ne).
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Reel (film it): Founder Reel: why we built it (and who Jax is)
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
