 cked file.\n\nMake it Just for fun with prize notes like “winner picks F
 riday lunch”. Send this to whoever owns the squares spreadsheet.\n\n#off
 icepool #footballsquares #thanksgivingfootball #worklife\n\nAlt text: A me
 ssy office squares spreadsheet with conflicting names and reply-all emails
  freezes\, then the JaxSquares invite sheet for an Office Game Day board\,
  coworkers picking squares and a live score calling a winner.\n\n• Has i
 ts own soundtrack: original JaxSquares music\, cut to the video\, so post 
